🛠️ Step-by-Step: Setting up the AI Agent in n8n
Create a New Workflow in your n8n instance.

Add a Webhook Node (or Chat Trigger):

Set HTTP Method to POST.

Set Path (e.g., ai-agent).

This generates a Test/Production URL that you can call from any external app.

Add the "AI Agent" Node:

Search for Advanced AI -> AI Agent.

Set the Agent Type to Conversational Agent.

Connect the output of your Webhook node to the AI Agent input.

Attach Model and Memory Nodes:

Drag a connection from the AI Agent's model input pin to an OpenAI Chat Model node (or your preferred LLM provider). Add your API credentials.

Drag a connection from the memory input pin to a Window Buffer Memory node to allow multi-turn conversations.
